 "title": {
  "zh": "算例 3：Fe XV (Z = 26)，Mg 样序列的单个元素",
  "en": "Case 3: Fe XV (Z = 26), one Mg-like ion"
 },
 "summary": {
  "zh": "原脚本实际对 Z = 26–60 循环 (不是 Z = 6–12)；这里只算 Z = 26，采用 z < 27 的首元素分支，独立计算角向数据。冻结 Ne 核，偶宇称 3s²、3p²、3d²、3s3d 和奇宇称 3s3p、3p3d 共 35 个能级；从 Dirac-Fock 到 n = 4、5 的价电子 SD MCDHF，随后 CI、超精细常数、E1 跃迁、LSJ 标记及能级表。单进程约 1 分钟。首层直接读 DFeven.w / DFodd.w，省去原脚本的副本。",
  "en": "The original actually loops over Z = 26–60 (not Z = 6–12); only Z = 26 is calculated, using the z < 27 branch with independent angular data. Frozen Ne core; 35 levels of even 3s², 3p², 3d², 3s3d and odd 3s3p, 3p3d. Dirac-Fock followed by valence SD MCDHF at n = 4, 5, CI, hyperfine constants, E1 transitions, LSJ labels and an energy table. About 1 minute serial. The first layer reads DFeven.w / DFodd.w directly, omitting the original copies."
 },
 "runtime": {
  "zh": "单进程约 1 分钟",
  "en": "about 1 minute serial"
 },
